      below left=1.8cm and 2.5cm of pred] (univ)
    {\textcolor{darkgreen}{\textbf{Universal}}\\
    $\forall x\, P(x)$\\
    True if ALL satisfy $P$\\
    Negation: $\exists x\, \neg P(x)$};

