      below right=1.8cm and 2.5cm of pred] (exis)
    {\textcolor{accentorange}{\textbf{Existential}}\\
    $\exists x\, P(x)$\\
    True if SOME satisfy $P$\\
    Negation: $\forall x\, \neg P(x)$};

