\begin{enumerate}[leftmargin=2em]
    \item Assign a propositional variable to each atomic statement.
    \item Translate all premises into symbolic form.
    \item Apply rules one at a time, labelling each step with the rule used.
    \item Build toward the desired conclusion systematically.
    \item Common pattern: Simplification $\rightarrow$ Modus Tollens $\rightarrow$
          Modus Ponens $\rightarrow$ Conjunction.
\end{enumerate}

